  "question": {
    "text": "Arrange the following alcohols in order of increasing reactivity towards sodium metal.<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>",
